The drug data in public/data/ and ml/cache/ is derived from ChEMBL, which is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported Licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Under that licence this
derived data is released on the same terms.

